      "behavior": "Target119 validates CLAUDE_CODE_ENTRYPOINT against the complete authenticated entrypoint catalog, including bench and ssh-remote, before adding it to GrowthBook attributes. Startup upgrades a pre-set cli entrypoint to sdk-cli for non-interactive execution and records fresh, resume, or continue from arguments before the -- separator."
    },
    {
      "key": "2.1.118-to-2.1.119:6644",
